  "title": {
    "zh": "传感器上报量核查",
    "en": "Sensor Transmission Audit"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "保留重发 · 按日计数 · 工作量排行",
    "en": "Retain retransmissions · Daily counts · Workload ranking"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "值班员要估算每天处理了多少条有温度的传感器来报。同一编号的重复上报也消耗处理时间，每条有效副本都要计一次。先交一份区域名统一、原始行位置仍完整的存档，再交处理了至少 3 条有效来报的日期排行榜。",
    "en": "Estimate how many sensor messages with valid temperatures the station handled per day. A retransmission takes time too, so count every valid copy of a repeated ID. First archive the original row positions with normalized area names, then rank days with at least three valid messages."
  },
  "prerequisites": [
    {
      "unit": "pandas",
      "topic": "cleaning"
    },
    {
      "unit": "statistics",
      "topic": "grouped-summary"
    },
    {
